<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Repel Lesser Undead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 2), Dark Knight (guild level 15), Paladin (guild level 15, up to 50%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast repel lesser undead &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster raises a hand, chants 'Muert dislux' and fills one undead 
creature with fear. While the fear lasts, every half minute in a fight 
there is a chance it flees. The better your spell, the longer it lasts: 
from a minute up to several minutes. On anything that isn't undead, 
nothing happens.
</p><p>The undead resist, and the spell may fail; either way, casting it starts a 
fight. It can be cast while fighting, and no free hands are needed. It is 
also found on wands, staffs and scrolls. Repel greater undead does the same 
to every undead in the room.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Repel Greater Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>